## 9. Genre Looks (Quick-Reference)

| Genre | Shots & Angles | Movement | Light & Color |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Neo-Noir** | Dutch angles, low angles, OTS | Slow push, slow track | Low-key, hard side light, rain reflections, neon accents |
| **Horror** | Wide with negative space, POV, rear angle | Slow creep, handheld panic | Underlighting, deep shadows, desaturated, practical flicker |
| **Epic / Fantasy** | EWS, low-angle hero, crane reveals | Crane up, drone, sweeping arc | Golden hour, volumetric god rays, rich color |
| **Sci-Fi** | Symmetrical wides, centered frames | Slow dolly, precise gimbal | Cool blue, neon cyan/magenta, clean steel |
| **Drama / Intimate** | MCU, CU, two-shot | Subtle handheld, static | Soft window light, naturalistic, muted palette |
| **Action / Thriller** | Mixed wides and CUs, low tracking | Handheld, whip pans, steadicam | High contrast, teal & orange, motion blur |
| **War / Gritty** | Handheld, long lens compression | Shaky, reactive | Bleach bypass, desaturated, dust and smoke |
| **Romance** | CU, shallow focus, two-shot | Slow orbit, gentle push | Golden hour, warm amber, soft diffusion |

