## 12. Examples

**A. Neo-Noir Interrogation (video)**
> A weary detective in a rumpled trench coat slowly lights a cigarette, jaw clenched, eyes fixed off-camera left with quiet menace. **Medium close-up, low angle**, subject on the right third with negative space and venetian-blind shadows behind. **Slow push-in**, imperceptible speed. **50mm anamorphic lens at f/2**, oval bokeh and subtle horizontal flare. **Low-key, hard motivated key light** from a window camera-left, thin rim light on the shoulder, volumetric cigarette smoke. **Teal shadows with warm amber skin tones**, Kodak Vision3 500T grain. Rain-streaked glass, dim office at night. **Tense, gritty, neo-noir.** 2.39:1, 24fps, 6 seconds.

**B. Epic Establishing Reveal (video)**
> A lone warrior in weathered armor stands on a cliff edge overlooking a vast burning valley, cloak whipping in the wind, shoulders heavy with resolve. **Extreme wide shot, high angle**, the figure small on the lower-left third, mountain ranges layered in foreground, midground and background. **Slow crane-up and pull-back reveal.** **24mm spherical lens at f/8**, deep focus. **Golden-hour backlight** with volumetric god rays through smoke, warm rim light on armor. **Rich amber and deep crimson palette**, 65mm film clarity, soft halation. **Awe, dread, epic fantasy.** 2.39:1, 24fps, 8 seconds.

**C. Intimate Drama Close-Up (still)**
> A young woman at a rain-covered window, eyes glistening, holding back tears behind a composed expression, gaze drifting past the camera. **Close-up, eye level, three-quarter angle**, face on the left third with soft out-of-focus city lights as bokeh. **85mm lens at f/1.4**, creamy shallow depth of field. **Soft, cool window key light**, faint warm practical lamp fill, gentle rim light on hair. **Muted blue-grey palette with warm skin tones**, fine 35mm grain. **Quiet grief, intimate, naturalistic.** 1.85:1.

